aces. \\nHave they reignited the spark or lit the match that burns it all down?\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Joe and Angela’s marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic \\nupstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"very strong language, strong sex references, drug misuse\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-03\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":106,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/ad147b9a-b731-410f-8bf9-c4f3f3df2095/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jnLW-q2ftKA\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jnLW-q2ftKA\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001093\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002460\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003915\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004392\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004710\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007157\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013073\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014130\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002460\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003915\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004392\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004710\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003915\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001093\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007157\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013073\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014130\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000003\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"ad147b9a-b731-410f-8bf9-c4f3f3df2095\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007147\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008799\",